        "text": "<thinking> To generate an embedding vector for a text string, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to various AI models, including those capable of generating embeddings. I will import the necessary Amazon Bedrock client and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
